	I find the glance at a run, pick up at a walk behavior of Nhack3.6,
to be both useful and intuitive.  If you feel that you must change this 
back, then add another option to pick-up to let it behave this way.

	BTW  Is anybody else harvesting magic traps?  I find them even more
useful than a wand of create monster.

	IMHO NH3.6 is the easiest version yet.  The problem is that 
identification is so powerful.  You only suffer one dose of each of the
'bad' effects, if that.  Why not include scrolls with smuged labels,
or very nasty: Traps of forgetfullness that make you forget (randomly)
the level, spells, or true identitys of items.

